---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Videos
seoTitle: "GTA 6 Trailers and Videos: Every Official Rockstar Video"
description: "Every official GTA 6 trailer and video from Rockstar Games in one place: Trailer 1, Trailer 2, An Extended Look and the Launch Trailer."
updated: 2026-11-17
---
<header class="mast" style="--glow:var(--violet)">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Watch</p>
    <h1>Trailers and videos</h1>
    <p class="tagline">Every official GTA 6 video from Rockstar Games, newest first. Videos play from Rockstar's YouTube channel and only load when you press play.</p>
    <div class="chips"><span class="chip ok dot">Official Rockstar videos</span><span class="chip plain">Spoiler-free</span></div>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="vids">
      {%- for v in videos %}
      <article class="vid{% if loop.first %} vid-main{% endif %}">
        {%- set poster = "/assets/img/video-" + v.slug + ".webp" %}
        {% include "partials/yt.njk" %}
        <div class="vid-body">
          <p class="pin">{{ v.date | niceDate }} · {{ v.length }}</p>
          <h2>{{ v.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ v.text }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>
    <p class="fig-credit">Videos and stills: Rockstar Games</p>
  </div>
</section>
<script type="application/ld+json">{{ videos | videold | safe }}</script>
